{"id":"c20","stage":3,"title":"研究生的讨论","scene":"和同学讨论课程安排及任务分工。","roles":["敏智","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c20-1","ko":"이번 학기에는 어떤 수업을 들을 예정이에요?","zh":"这学期打算选什么课？","note":"수업을 듣다：上课；예정：预定。","words":[{"term":"이번","zh":"这次","id":"da78d4146f0588e8","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"},{"term":"학기","zh":"学期","id":"a95c145d8eb8427e","audio":"/audio/a95c145d8eb8427ea655.mp3"},{"term":"예정","zh":"计划","id":"8688e9ff7c84e0e4","audio":"/audio/8688e9ff7c84e0e44571.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/db7c558f0b9cbc0c704e.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次","explanation":"이번修饰학기，组成“这学期”。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"},{"term":"학기","audio":"/audio/a95c145d8eb8427ea655.mp3"}]},{"text":"학기에는","meaning":"学期","explanation":"학기（学期）+ 에（时间）+ 는（话题）。","readings":[{"term":"학기","audio":"/audio/a95c145d8eb8427ea655.mp3"}]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"什么","explanation":"어떤询问种类。","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}]},{"text":"수업을","meaning":"课程","explanation":"수업（课）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"수업을","audio":"/audio/76fb50d43a88762ff43c.mp3"}]},{"text":"들을","meaning":"上的","explanation":"듣다（听、上课）→ 들을，ㄷ不规则的定语形。","readings":[{"term":"들을","audio":"/audio/fd59edfe1d7db8276fb2.mp3"}]},{"text":"예정이에요?","meaning":"打算？","explanation":"예정（计划）+ 이에요（是）；-(으)ㄹ 예정意为“计划做”。","readings":[{"term":"예정","audio":"/audio/8688e9ff7c84e0e44571.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c20-2","ko":"연구 방법론을 신청했어요.","zh":"我选了研究方法论。","note":"신청하다：申请、报名。","words":[{"term":"연구","zh":"研究","id":"a0eadd0b05bc2eca","audio":"/audio/a0eadd0b05bc2ecac43d.mp3"},{"term":"방법론","zh":"方法论","id":"f738003a22b18c10","audio":"/audio/f738003a22b18c10e28a.mp3"},{"term":"신청하다","zh":"申请；报名","id":"c1315f39378bdc6e","audio":"/audio/c1315f39378bdc6e1dd4.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/7516649201deb3d66d58.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"연구","meaning":"研究","explanation":"연구修饰방법론。","readings":[{"term":"연구","audio":"/audio/a0eadd0b05bc2ecac43d.mp3"},{"term":"방법론","audio":"/audio/f738003a22b18c10e28a.mp3"}]},{"text":"방법론을","meaning":"方法论","explanation":"방법론（方法论）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"방법론","audio":"/audio/f738003a22b18c10e28a.mp3"}]},{"text":"신청했어요.","meaning":"选了／报名了","explanation":"신청하다（申请、报名）的过去礼貌形式；此处指选课。","readings":[{"term":"신청하다","audio":"/audio/c1315f39378bdc6e1dd4.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c20-3","ko":"발표와 보고서 중에 뭐가 더 부담돼요?","zh":"口头报告和书面报告，哪个让你压力更大？","note":"课堂语境中 발표 指口头报告，보고서 指书面报告；중에 表示从若干对象中选择。","words":[{"term":"발표","zh":"口头报告（课堂语境）","id":"662fbb8d7bdeae80","audio":"/audio/662fbb8d7bdeae8019f6.mp3"},{"term":"보고서","zh":"报告","id":"01a64adf7f150065","audio":"/audio/01a64adf7f1500650cfd.mp3"},{"term":"부담되다","zh":"感到负担","id":"09e52a36d82ed2a0","audio":"/audio/09e52a36d82ed2a05a23.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/a9930063d0ca6876e85b.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"발표와","meaning":"口头报告和","explanation":"발표（发表、演讲）+ 와（和）；课堂语境译为口头报告。","readings":[{"term":"발표","audio":"/audio/662fbb8d7bdeae8019f6.mp3"}]},{"text":"보고서","meaning":"书面报告","explanation":"보고서（报告书），与口头发表对比。","readings":[{"term":"보고서","audio":"/audio/01a64adf7f1500650cfd.mp3"}]},{"text":"중에","meaning":"之中","explanation":"중（中）+ 에（范围）。","readings":[{"term":"중에","audio":"/audio/f0d257645978930f07ec.mp3"}]},{"text":"뭐가","meaning":"哪个","explanation":"뭐（什么）+ 가（主格）；此处在两项中选择。","readings":[{"term":"뭐가","audio":"/audio/2c57e944c5dd1dbd2cf3.mp3"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更","explanation":"더表示比较程度。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}]},{"text":"부담돼요?","meaning":"让你有压力？","explanation":"부담되다（成为负担）→ 부담돼요。","readings":[{"term":"부담되다","audio":"/audio/09e52a36d82ed2a05a23.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c20-4","ko":"아직은 발표가 더 부담돼요.","zh":"目前还是口头报告更让我有压力。","note":"아직은 强调现阶段；발표 在这里指课堂上的口头报告。","words":[{"term":"아직","zh":"目前还","id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/69863f69b9213c307f11.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"아직은","meaning":"目前还","explanation":"아직（还）+ 은（强调现阶段）。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}]},{"text":"발표가","meaning":"口头报告","explanation":"발표（发表、演讲）+ 가（主格）。","readings":[{"term":"발표가","audio":"/audio/cf73a55b8263fc92e295.mp3"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更","explanation":"더表示比较程度。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}]},{"text":"부담돼요.","meaning":"让我有压力","explanation":"부담되다的礼貌形式；压力承受者根据上文省略。","readings":[{"term":"부담돼요","audio":"/audio/0c3c5581f1e93df04603.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c20-5","ko":"역할을 나누면 준비하기가 수월할 거예요.","zh":"分工的话，准备起来会轻松些。","note":"-기가 接形容词，说明做某事的感受。","words":[{"term":"역할","zh":"角色；任务","id":"7258c17132926a4b","audio":"/audio/7258c17132926a4ba78b.mp3"},{"term":"나누다","zh":"分配","id":"8a88d2ae9895b06e","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3"},{"term":"수월하다","zh":"容易；轻松","id":"c8df24319cc6eb89","audio":"/audio/c8df24319cc6eb896670.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/6fffed5dded0249d1706.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"역할을","meaning":"任务","explanation":"역할（角色、任务）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"역할","audio":"/audio/7258c17132926a4ba78b.mp3"}]},{"text":"나누면","meaning":"分配的话","explanation":"나누다（分配）+ -면（条件）。","readings":[{"term":"나누다","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3"}]},{"text":"준비하기가","meaning":"准备起来","explanation":"준비하다（准备）+ -기（名词化）+ 가（主格）。","readings":[{"term":"준비하기가","audio":"/audio/4770c59fb5dfe8a45011.mp3"}]},{"text":"수월할","meaning":"轻松","explanation":"수월하다（轻松、容易）+ -ㄹ，修饰것。","readings":[{"term":"수월하다","audio":"/audio/c8df24319cc6eb896670.mp3"}]},{"text":"거예요.","meaning":"会","explanation":"것이에요 → 거예요；-(으)ㄹ 거예요在这里表示预测。","readings":[{"term":"거예요","audio":"/audio/ce83694d33e9399b0229.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c20-6","ko":"그럼 저는 자료를 정리할게요.","zh":"那我来整理资料。","note":"主动承担一项任务。","words":[{"term":"자료","zh":"资料","id":"6416867e47259489","audio":"/audio/6416867e472594899d64.mp3"},{"term":"정리하다","zh":"整理","id":"7b53a03fb69e532d","audio":"/audio/7b53a03fb69e532df421.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/2a01f4ee86ff67750021.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那","explanation":"그러면的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}]},{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저（我，谦称）+ 는（提示话题）。","readings":[{"term":"저는","audio":"/audio/0b05af6c0b14d6e70820.mp3"}]},{"text":"자료를","meaning":"资料","explanation":"자료（资料）+ 를（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"자료","audio":"/audio/6416867e472594899d64.mp3"}]},{"text":"정리할게요.","meaning":"我来整理","explanation":"정리하다（整理）+ -ㄹ게요（主动表明计划）。","readings":[{"term":"정리하다","audio":"/audio/7b53a03fb69e532df421.mp3"}]}]}],"day":96,"sequenceScore":1.6934,"questions":[{"lineIndex":2,"options":["口头报告和书面报告，哪个准备得更快？","口头报告和书面报告，哪个让你压力更大？","口头报告和书面报告，哪个更受老师欢迎？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":4,"options":["独自承担全部任务，准备起来会轻松些。","即使分工，准备起来也不会更轻松。","分工的话，准备起来会轻松些。"],"answer":2}]}
